@startuml
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ06 UC06 个人视频资料库管理（组件级·Library）
actor "用户" as U
participant "UserLibraryPage / VideoPlayer" as P
participant "libraryApi / videoApi" as A
participant "Gin Router + AuthMiddleware" as R
participant "libraryHandler (History/WatchLater)" as H
participant "videoHandler (Like/Collect)" as VH
database "MySQL: WatchHistory / WatchLater / Like / Collect" as DB
participant "localStorage (liked/collections/downloads)" as LS

== 历史记录：保存进度 ==
U -> P: 在 VideoPlayer 中播放视频并触发 timeupdate
P -> A: libraryApi.saveHistory(videoId, position) 节流调用
A -> R: PUT /api/v1/users/me/history/:videoId + Bearer Token
R -> H: SaveHistoryHandler(ctx)
H -> DB: SELECT Video (id, duration, status=approved)
alt 视频不存在或未审核
  DB --> H: 空结果
  H --> R: HTTP 404 "视频不存在"
  R --> A: 404
  A --> P: 静默忽略
else 视频存在
  H -> DB: UPSERT WatchHistory(user_id,video_id,position,updated_at)
  DB --> H: 持久化成功
  H --> R: 200 { videoId, position }
  R --> A: 200
  A --> P: 进度已保存
end

== 历史记录：列表查询与继续观看 ==
U -> P: 进入 /me/history
P -> A: libraryApi.history({ page:1, pageSize:100 })
A -> R: GET /api/v1/users/me/history
R -> H: HistoryListHandler(ctx)
H -> DB: JOIN videos + 分页查询 WatchHistory ORDER BY updated_at DESC
DB --> H: 列表 + Author 预加载
H -> H: toLibraryRecord(progress = position*100/duration)
H --> R: 200 { list, total, page, pageSize }
R --> A: 200
A --> P: 渲染列表卡片与进度条
U -> P: 点击某条「继续观看」
P -> P: 跳转 /video/:id?t=position

== 稍后再看：切换 ==
U -> P: 点击「稍后再看」按钮
P -> A: libraryApi.toggleWatchLater(videoId)
A -> R: POST /api/v1/users/me/watch-later/:videoId
R -> H: ToggleWatchLaterHandler(ctx)
H -> DB: SELECT Video (id WHERE status=approved)
H -> DB: SELECT WatchLater(user,video)
alt 已存在
  H -> DB: DELETE WatchLater
  H --> R: 200 { saved:false }
else 不存在
  H -> DB: INSERT WatchLater(user,video)
  H --> R: 200 { saved:true }
end
R --> A: 200
A --> P: 按钮状态更新

== 清空记录 ==
U -> P: 点击「清空」按钮 → ElMessageBox 二次确认
alt history/watchlater
  P -> A: libraryApi.clearHistory() / clearWatchLater()
  A -> R: DELETE /users/me/history or /watch-later
  R -> H: ClearHistoryHandler / ClearWatchLaterHandler
  H -> DB: Unscoped DELETE WHERE user_id = ?
  DB --> H: 影响行数
  H --> R: 200 { cleared:true }
else liked/collections/downloads
  P -> LS: clearUserLibraryRecords(kind)
  LS --> P: 已清空
end
P -> P: loadRecords() 重新拉取或读取本地
@enduml
